# Optional Hugging Face token for the public Bria RMBG 2.0 ZeroGPU Space.
# Use a token with read access to public Spaces to use your account's free quota.
# Without a token, the app falls back to Hugging Face's shared anonymous quota.
# The existing HF_TOKEN variable is also accepted as a fallback.
# Server-side only; never use a VITE_ prefix or commit a real token.
HF_SPACE_TOKEN=
